_ row-offset Size
    - view Text
    - row Index
    - x Length

if rect == null then 0 else view.offset-at(Point(x, rect.y + rect.height / 2))

.. rect = view.row-rect(row)

────────────────────
_ do vertical-neighbor MarkdownPoint?
    - point MarkdownPoint
    - down Bool
    - x Length

. block = blocks[point.block]
if block.kind == MarkdownBlockKind.grid && block.columns > 0
    . columns = block.columns
    if down && point.cell + columns < block.cells.length
        = MarkdownPoint(point.block, point.cell + columns, 0)
    if !down && point.cell >= columns
        = MarkdownPoint(point.block, point.cell - columns, 0)
. index Size? = null
if down
